's nomination without difficulty in May. Every major race rating, from Cook and Inside Elections to Sabato's Crystal Ball and the Economist, places the contest in the Safe or Solid Republican column.\n\nThe resource gap underscores the imbalance: Capito has raised about $4.6 million and holds $4.4 million on hand, while Anderson has raised under $50,000. No public general-election polls are available, but prediction markets give Anderson roughly a one to two percent chance of an upset. A Constitution Party candidate also appears on the ballot. The forecast expects a comfortable Capito victory.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.008, "margin": -17.55}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0111, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.0053, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.0155, "margin": -17.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.0118, "margin": -17.4}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.0008, "margin": -24.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.0129, "margin": -17.4}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.0067, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.0052, "margin": -20.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.0041, "margin": -20.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.0101, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.0095, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.0099, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.0063, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.0083, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.0066, "margin": -20.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.0039, "margin": -20.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.0056, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.0054, "margin": -20.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.0076, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.0101, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.0086, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.0112, "margin": -17.5}]}